      "text": "recursive - DFS\n    preorder\n    inorder\n    postorder\n\niterative - queue -> BFS\n    level order traversal\n        single line - nothing\n        seperate line - for loop\n    zig zag - alternate\n    left view - i = 0\n    right view - i = curr_q_size-1",
